# Historical 2014 bot progression acceptance.
# Controller input comes from SNESREF_INPUT_FILE.
# Baseline is after SRAM/frontend initialization but before first race entry (frame 794).
# The bot targets Crawler first; bounded snapshots stop as soon as the workflow sees a medal mutation.
wait 750
dump progression-before
wait 3250
